THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER FILE.

In a real implementation, you would use an image conversion tool
to create a PNG version of the SVG icon. Since we can't directly
create binary images through this interface, this placeholder
reminds you to generate the actual PNG icon file separately.

You can use tools like:
- ImageMagick: convert icon.svg icon.png
- Inkscape: inkscape -o icon.png icon.svg
- Or any online SVG to PNG converter

This PNG file should be referenced in the glama.json configuration.